Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.4.30-rt43 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.4.30 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: 996b2646e323516854406a4fa82f2411b082df88


Or to build 3.4.30-rt43 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.4.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.4.30.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.4/patch-3.4.30-rt43.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve
